The FSG/OP Spool Group has completed what is to be the final draft of v1.0
of the PAPI specification.  The release request for this specification can
be found at


ftp://ftp.pwg.org/fsg/steering_committee/PAPI-Version-0100-Release-Action/pa
pi-v1.0-release-request-v1.02-2005-06-15.pdf
<ftp://ftp.pwg.org/fsg/steering_committee/PAPI-Version-0100-Release-Action/p
api-v1.0-release-request-v1.02-2005-06-15.pdf> 


If contains information about the release package awaiting review.  

Please take some time to look through the package and review it.  All
comments should be posted to the Spool list
(printing-spool@mail.freestandards.org) and cross post to the Architecture
list (printing-architecture@mail.freestandards.org).  Final comments should
be in no later than midnight CDT July 15, 2005.
The specification is located at
ftp://ftp.pwg.org/fsg/spool/papi-v1.0-2005-05-09.pdf
<ftp://ftp.pwg.org/fsg/spool/papi-v1.0-2005-05-09.pdf> 

